    "detailed_description": "Deep idle game with NO ads, and NO in-app-purchases!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWatch your pixelated fleet battle in real-time. Build up your economy, upgrade your ships, and collect a variety of loot from dead enemy ships to assist your ships in battle!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBalance resources such as food, metal, crystal, gold, rations, alloy, circuits, and more! Build Gulls, Armored Cruisers, Bombers, Guards, and more to fight for you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnce you get far enough, prestige into a multi-layered &quot;job&quot; system, where each job has a different play style, and offers unique purchasable prestige bonuses that benefit ALL jobs!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow many jobs can you master? What level can you reach?",
